From: Martin Pluskal <martin@pluskal.org>
Subject: keep the Harness off the legacy import path

_provided_tools imports mistralai_vibe_local_harness.protocol at module scope,
so the module-scope import of it here pulled the Harness distribution in for
every app-server import -- including the legacy path, which must run without
it (the neighbouring imports below say so).  vibe_tool_groups() is only ever
called from build_unified_session_context(), so import it there.

